  "task_html": "<div class='task-block task-blue'><div class='task-block-label'>Das Schulfest-Glücksrad</div><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 10px 0;'>Euer Gl&uuml;cksrad hat drei ungleich gro&szlig;e Felder. Der ganze Kreis ist 100&nbsp;%. Die kleinen Striche am Rand markieren 10-%-Schritte.</p><svg viewBox='0 0 180 180' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' style='width:190px;display:block;margin:8px auto;'><path d='M 90 90 L 90.00 35.00 A 55 55 0 0 1 142.31 73.00 Z' fill='#2563eb'/><path d='M 90 90 L 142.31 73.00 A 55 55 0 0 1 90.00 145.00 Z' fill='#d97706'/><path d='M 90 90 L 90.00 145.00 A 55 55 0 0 1 90.00 35.00 Z' fill='#6d28d9'/><circle cx='90' cy='90' r='55' fill='none' stroke='#1C1B1F' stroke-width='1.5'/><line x1='90.00' y1='35.00' x2='90.00' y2='28.00' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='122.33' y1='45.50' x2='126.44' y2='39.84' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='142.31' y1='73.00' x2='148.97' y2='70.84' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='142.31' y1='107.00' x2='148.97' y2='109.16' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='122.33' y1='134.50' x2='126.44' y2='140.16' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='90.00' y1='145.00' x2='90.00' y2='152.00' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='57.67' y1='134.50' x2='53.56' y2='140.16' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='37.69' y1='107.00' x2='31.03' y2='109.16' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='37.69' y1='73.00' x2='31.03' y2='70.84' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='57.67' y1='45.50' x2='53.56' y2='39.84' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='90.00' y='16.00' text-anchor='middle' font-size='10' fill='#6b7280'>0%</text><text x='167.00' y='93.00' text-anchor='middle' font-size='10' fill='#6b7280'>25%</text><text x='90.00' y='170.00' text-anchor='middle' font-size='10' fill='#6b7280'>50%</text><text x='13.00' y='93.00' text-anchor='middle' font-size='10' fill='#6b7280'>75%</text></svg><p style='font-size:13px;line-height:2;margin:8px 0 0 0;'><span style='display:inline-block;width:11px;height:11px;background:#2563eb;border-radius:2px;margin-right:6px;'></span>Gewinn &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style='display:inline-block;width:11px;height:11px;background:#d97706;border-radius:2px;margin-right:6px;'></span>Trostpreis &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style='display:inline-block;width:11px;height:11px;background:#6d28d9;border-radius:2px;margin-right:6px;'></span>Niete</p></div><div class='task-block task-orange' style='margin-top:12px;'><div class='task-block-label'>Aufgabe</div><div class='tbl-wrap'><table><thead><tr><th style='background:#2563eb;'>P(Gewinn) (%)</th><th style='background:#6d28d9;'>P(Niete) (%)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='20' placeholder='?'></td><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='50' placeholder='?'></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style='font-size:14px;margin:12px 0 8px 0;'>Am Schulfest drehen 40 Kinder das Rad. Wie viele bekommen schätzungsweise einen <strong>Trostpreis</strong> (30&nbsp;%)?</p><input class='cell-input' data-ans='12' placeholder='Wie viele Kinder?'></div><div class='check-bar'><button class='btn-check' onclick='checkStation(11)'>&#x2713; &Uuml;berpr&uuml;fen</button><button class='btn-reset' onclick='resetStation(11)'>&#x21BA; Zur&uuml;cksetzen</button><span class='check-result' id='check-result-11'></span></div>",
  "sol_html": "<div style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;'>Gewinn: <strong>20&nbsp;%</strong> (0&nbsp;% bis 20&nbsp;%)<br>Niete: <strong>50&nbsp;%</strong> (50&nbsp;% bis 100&nbsp;%)<br>Trostpreis bei 40 Kindern: 40 : 100 &middot; 30 = <strong>12 Kinder</strong></div>"
